  "decision_conditions": [
    "INCLUSIVE DESIGN (COMPLIANCE): The development shall be designed in accordance with the principles of Inclusive Design. To achieve this the development shall incorporate/install: \n\na) An external wheelchair accessible ramp.\nb) A platform lift providing access to the first floor.\nc) An Entryphone at wheelchair height. \nd) A wheelchair accessible WC/shower room at first floor level.\n\nThe development shall be carried out strictly in accordance with the details so approved, shall be maintained as such thereafter and no change there from shall take place without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.\n\nREASON: In order to facilitate and promote inclusive and sustainable \ncommunities."
  ],
